{
  "schema": "ora.toolkit-tool.v1",
  "name": "rotate_pitch",
  "description": "Tilt the current approach axis while holding position.\nUse when: rotating the right TCP about its lateral axis (TCP local +Y) while holding position — for example tilting the approach direction between top-down and side grasps.\nEffect: compiles the signed angle to an exact pose through canonical move_pose; it executes as a precision move: a turn of more than 15 degrees plans as move_pose describes, a smaller one runs on the bounded Cartesian servo. One robot decision. speed, speed_m_s and slow_approaching (optional) work as on move_pose.\nReturns: an immediate acknowledgement with status=submitted, action and compiled_pose; compiled_pose.targets contains the compiled requested target, not a measured arrival. The subsequent Supervisor receipt and fresh causal observation separately report execution route, phase outcomes and measured residuals. A pre-admission error submits no action.\nDoes not: translate, command the gripper, or prove the new approach direction clears obstacles — verify from a fresh observation.\nOn error: Refused: an angle outside [-180, 180] degrees or not a finite number; an angle of 0; a target outside the bound action workspace (workspace_bounds), which includes any rotation while the TCP is already outside it; the episode's terminal boundary (episode_terminal). Speed options are refused as on move_pose. Check the current TCP axes and correct the sign or magnitude; use move_pose when position must change together with orientation. Numerical inputs follow compute's Use when rule; send every value in this tool's declared units and frame. Its compiled_pose targets carry reach_along_request, the same approximate pre-check as move_pose's.",
  "inputSchema": {
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "angle_deg": {
        "description": "Signed rotation in degrees about the TCP lateral axis (TCP local +Y), holding position.",
        "maximum": 180,
        "minimum": -180,
        "type": "number"
      },
      "speed": {
        "type": [
          "string",
          "null"
        ],
        "enum": [
          "fast",
          "normal",
          "careful",
          null
        ],
        "description": "Optional; default fast. As move_pose's speed. Leave it out when you give speed_m_s. Null means omitted."
      },
      "speed_m_s": {
        "type": [
          "number",
          "null"
        ],
        "description": "Optional, instead of speed: as move_pose's speed_m_s. Null means omitted."
      },
      "slow_approaching": {
        "type": [
          "boolean",
          "null"
        ],
        "description": "Optional; default false. As move_pose's slow_approaching. Null means omitted."
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "angle_deg"
    ],
    "type": "object"
  },
  "resultSchema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "status": {
